  "question": {
    "text": "From a point on the line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> tangents are drawn to the hyperbola <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> such that the chord of contact passes through a fixed point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then,&nbsp;<math><mi>μ</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "5ZhgC",
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
